<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><b style=""><a href="http://www.servicefirstmtg.com/toddbaker"><br><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Todd Baker's contact info</font> </a></b>below and complete the application. Todd's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Century, serif; color: rgb(31, 73, 125);">&nbsp;<u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(31, 73, 125);"><a href="http://www.servicefirstmtg.com/toddbaker"><img width="800" height="258" id="m_-7843178971053739792m_6239271493193692128Picture_x0020_1" src="https://mail.google.